<title>GERMANY: TABLE-Didier H1 profit drops after Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Didier H1 profit drops after Q1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     2.7     vs   5.1</p>
<p>    Group sales				691.2     vs 636.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German engineering group is Didier-werke AG.</p>
<p>In its results statement, Didier said it expected 1997 full-year profits to exceed the levels reached in 1996, when it increased its net profit by 12 percent to 18.5 million marks.</p>
<p>The firm posted a pre-tax loss of 8.8 million marks in  the first quarter of this year.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
